b.com/users/bazelbuild/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazelbuild/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazelbuild/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazelbuild/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazelbuild/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazelbuild/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazelbuild/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/rules_rust","description":"Rust rules for Bazel","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/deployments","created_at":"2016-03-15T15:19:27Z","updated_at":"2025-12-11T16:04:13Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-11T21:29:04Z","git_url":"git://github.com/bazelbuild/rules_rust.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:bazelbuild/rules_rust.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/rules_rust.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/rules_rust","homepage":"https://bazelbuild.github.io/rules_rust/","size":55687,"stargazers_count":777,"watchers_count":777,"language":"Starlark","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":529,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":663,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["bazel","bazel-rules","rust","rust-lang","rustdoc"],"visibility":"public","forks":529,"open_issues":663,"watchers":777,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/pulls/1044","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/rules_rust/pull/1044","diff_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/rules_rust/pull/1044.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/rules_rust/pull/1044.patch","merged_at":"2021-12-06T18:01:11Z"},"body":"In order to link to a DLL into a `cc_*` target, one usually needs an import library (interface library in Bazel parlance) for the linker to resolve the calls to the DLL functions into the calling code, as documented here: https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/dlls/dynamic-link-library-creation#creating-an-import-library.\r\n\r\nThe way to then use said DLL would be via a `cc_import` that is setup as follows:\r\n\r\n```\r\ncc_import(\r\n    name = \"mylib.dll\",\r\n    interface_library = \":mylib.lib\",\r\n    shared_library = \":mylib\",\r\n)\r\n\r\nfilegroup(\r\n    name = \"mylib.lib\",\r\n    srcs = [\":mylib\"],\r\n    output_group = \"interface_library\",\r\n)\r\n    \r\nrust_shared_library(\r\n    name = \"mylib\",\r\n    ...\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn order to achieve that, this patch includes an `OutputGroupInfo` provider that has its `interface_library` set to the one generated by rustc.\r\n\r\nI wasn't super in love with adding platform-specific logic to `rustc.bzl` but 1) I noticed that we were already doing something similar for wasm and 2) not doing so would likely require changing `CrateInfo`'s output to be a sequence rather than a single file and that probably requires quite a few more changes and possibly messy code that assumes that the sequence only has a single file for anything but Windows dynamic libs. Please do let me know if you disagree with my assessment 😄.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/issues/1044/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/rules_rust/issues/1044/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]